      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just misinterpretation though. it's too specific. like, i'll see a post from my brother and it uses a specific slang i only use when i'm tired, or it mentions a joke we had yesterday that i never posted anywhere. it feels like the data was just... harvested. if an AI's job is to predict the next word, and it has access to everything i've ever written, wouldn't it eventually just be able to output exactly what i would say? it's like there's a shadow version of me running around. how can you be so sure it isn't happening?",
